# A mail client whose open message scrolls in a box of its own (Gmail): ArrowLeft from the side panel stopped on the whole message, a list item taller than the window, and from its first link ArrowDown left for the folders on the left. A box taller than the window is entered, and the message box scrolls before the ring leaves it.
